Mape's Tower v2: the hand-over attempt (handover agent, 2026-10-16), reverted. See SECOND-ORDER.md TC2-7..11.
What it does: rings placed by height on past the shaft's top; one more ring (the last's bottoms over the rim);
the portal's lane rows across the hollow (5, 3, 2 lanes) rising 5 m a station from the top ring's bottoms;
`TowerLayout::is_lane_beam`; the AI takes lane beams by place (nearest station ahead along the course's way,
nearest its line, never behind, regardless of station); the portal pad 8 m past the tear; entry lanes +-3.
Apply with `git apply notes/tower2-handover-attempt.patch` on 8f803b4 (the trace example's hunk is already in).

